TEXT 128 624 Left 1 ;HOW TO VIEW WAVEFORMS  (note only - you may delete it, the circuit is not affected)\n1. Click Run (running-man icon). A black waveform window opens; it is empty at first.\n2. Put the mouse on the transistor symbol M1. The cursor becomes a current clamp. Click.\n3. The curve Id(M1) appears (X-axis = Vgs).\n4. Or: click the waveform window, Plot Settings > Add Trace, choose Id(M1) in the list, click OK.\n5. Remove a trace: Plot Settings > Delete Traces, then click the trace name. Press Esc to stop.
